---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import CaseStudies from "../../common-compo/CaseStudies.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-10 md:gap-12 lg:gap-14 xl:gap-16 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                What Sets Warehouster Apart
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto">
                Land acquisition is the foundation of successful warehouse development—impacting location strategy, scalability, legal compliance, and operational efficiency.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/land-acq-local-presence.webp" alt="local-presence" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Strong Local Presence in Key Industrial Clusters:
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Deep insights and relationships in Chennai, Bengaluru, Hosur & Madurai markets.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/land-acq-brownfield.webp" alt="brownfield" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Brownfield & Greenfield Portfolio:
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        We develop both fresh (greenfield) sites and transform existing infrastructure (brownfield), depending on client needs.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/land-acq-connectivity.webp" alt="connectivity" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Connectivity-led Site Selection:
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Highways, ports, road networks, and consumption centres are always part of our selection criteria.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/land-acq-govt.webp" alt="govt" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Government & Community Partnerships:
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Liaising with local authorities and community stakeholders to ensure smooth approvals and social license.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/land-acq-scalable.webp" alt="scalable" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Scalable Land Parcels:
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Our selected land allows incremental expansion, ensuring future growth is feasible.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="w-full flex-center my-6 md:my-8 lg:my-12 pt-10">
    <CaseStudies />
</section>
</>

